mbaexchange-kaseya:greenhouse:6011438004.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaseya&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;226&quot; data-end=&quot;568&quot;&gt;Kaseya is the leading provider of AI-powered IT management and cybersecurity software, serving Managed Service Providers (MSPs) and internal IT organizations worldwide. Our comprehensive platform helps organizations efficiently manage, secure, and automate their IT environments, driving operational efficiency and long-term business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;570&quot; data-end=&quot;898&quot;&gt;Backed by &lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.insightpartners.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;654&quot;&gt;Insight Partners&lt;/a&gt;, a leading global software investor, Kaseya has experienced sustained double-digit growth and continues to expand its global footprint. Today, Kaseya supports customers in more than 20 countries and manages over 15 million endpoints worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;900&quot; data-end=&quot;1191&quot;&gt;Founded in 2000, Kaseya has built a culture centered around innovation, accountability, and results. We are a high-growth, high-performance organization that values individuals who are driven, adaptable, and committed to delivering exceptional outcomes for our customers and teammates alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1193&quot; data-end=&quot;1468&quot;&gt;At Kaseya, success comes from embracing challenges, moving with urgency, and continuously raising the bar.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;17&quot; data-end=&quot;592&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Cybersecurity Instructional Designer to develop engaging, accurate, and accessible security awareness and compliance training content for both technical and non-technical audiences. This role combines instructional design, research, writing, and visual storytelling to turn complex cybersecurity and compliance topics into short, effective learning experiences. The ideal candidate will create story-driven microlearning content that improves learner understanding of security risks, compliance requirements, and secure behaviors across a range of audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;624&quot; data-end=&quot;1675&quot;&gt;Design and develop cybersecurity, security awareness, and compliance training content for technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create story-driven microlearning modules ranging from 30 seconds to 5 minutes in length&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and translate complex cybersecurity and compliance topics into clear, accurate, and engaging learning experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write realistic scenarios and training content on topics such as phishing, AI threats, social engineering, NIST, HIPAA, GDPR, and secure development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailor messaging, tone, and level of technical depth based on the target audience, including IT professionals, developers, and general employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently build subject-matter expertise in new cybersecurity and compliance topics as needed to support content development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use eLearning, video, and design tools to produce visually engaging and accessible learning content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to ensure training content aligns with security awareness goals, compliance requirements, and learner needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1677&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1677&quot; data-end=&quot;1704&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1706&quot; data-end=&quot;2315&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience creating cybersecurity, security awareness, or compliance training content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in instructional design, curriculum development, adult learning, microlearning, or storyboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience writing content for both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience researching cybersecurity or compliance topics and developing original training content from that research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of hands-on experience using eLearning, video, or design tools such as Vyond, Articulate Rise, Storyline, Synthesia, Camtasia, Canva, or Captivate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2317&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2317&quot; data-end=&quot;2345&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2347&quot; data-end=&quot;3021&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in communications, journalism, English, instructional design, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in content management, curriculum development, or a similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience developing content related to cybersecurity threats, trends, best practices, or security awareness methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience creating compliance-related training content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing short-form, scenario-based, or story-driven learning experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing in a clear, engaging, and narrative-driven tone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with content management systems and strong verbal, written, editing, and proofreading skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Kaseya provides equal employment opportunity to all employees and applicants without regard to race, religion, age, ancestry, gender, sex, sexual orientation, national origin, citizenship status, physical or mental disability, veteran status, marital status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

mbaexchange-nice:greenhouse:4848332101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NICE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what’s the role all about?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud System Administrators ensure the security, reliability, and performance of the organization’s computing platforms, servers, and hardware. They proactively monitor systems, address incidents, and maintain both cloud and data center environments. By managing operating systems, applying updates, and optimizing infrastructure, they safeguard business continuity and enable seamless operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How will you make an impact? &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain, monitor, and support a production infrastructure environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports multiple systems or applications of medium to high complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follows defined procedures to monitor systems and resolve issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzes and reports on operational metrics to understand performance and ensure success in process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs routine maintenance tasks for infrastructure systems such as backups, patching, application versions, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage DNS, FTP, IIS, and Application environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and maintain server system and file security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain documentation of servers and related infrastructure equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the On-Call rotation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates events to stakeholders, teams, and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cabling, racking, and other tasks in Physical Data Centers (Some Travel May Be Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create user accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updating Production Server Resources and Sizing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow the company Code of Ethics and CXone policies and procedures at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows Server Operating System&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft OS Patching and Critical Updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate Level of System Troubleshooting Skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years working in a large production infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in Windows Server Administration in a Production Environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years configuring server hardware and OS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Windows Domains, Active Directory, DNS, Mail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing VMware environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Hardware Replacements/Vendor Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a PCI / Cyber Essentials compliant environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with SAN&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Okta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Change Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing HP branded servers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing Cisco UCS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience monitoring and maintaining AWS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with PowerShell and other scripting languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about the &lt;u&gt;Benefits at NICE &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an ever-growing, market-disrupting, global company where the teams – comprised of the best of the best – work in a fast-paced, collaborative, and creative environment! As the market leader, every day at NICE is a chance to learn and grow, and there are endless internal career opportunities across multiple roles, disciplines, domains, and locations. If you are passionate, innovative, and excited to constantly raise the bar, you may just be our next NICEr!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
